      "name": "Modding Stats Helper - by wara",
      "slug": "modding-stats-helper-by-wara",
      "teaser": "Adds a tooltip when hovering parts in the weapon building screen that shows a quick overview of relevant stats and comparisons.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1814.png",
      "downloads": 64597,
      "favourites_count": 75,
      "description": "<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1442-modding-stats-helper/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ORIGINAL MOD</a></p>\n<p>ALL CREDIT GOES TO <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/25757-wara/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">wara</a></p>\n<p>I just recompiled the mod for SPT 4.0.X.</p>\n<p>People were right to ask me if my <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1795-trader-modding-and-improved-weapon-building/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Improved Weapon Building Mod</a> would get some stat tooltips.</p>\n<p>But wara already created this amazing mod, so just use this one</p>\n",
